CLEC reader webfonts
====================

These WOFF2 files are subsets/format conversions of official SIL Open Font
License 1.1 fonts, for web embedding in the CLEC reader only. They are not
sold as standalone desktop fonts. Full OFL text is in the OFL-*.txt files
beside this notice. Official sources were re-checked on 2026-11-13.

1) Source Han Sans CN Regular (chip label: 思源黑体)
   Project: https://github.com/adobe-fonts/source-han-sans
   Official file: SubsetOTF/CN/SourceHanSansCN-Regular.otf (release branch, v2.005R)
   License: SIL OFL 1.1 — see OFL-SourceHanSans.txt
   Reserved Font Name: 'Source'
   This WOFF2 is a GB2312 + punctuation + Latin subset, Regular only.
   CSS family used here: CLEC-SHSans (to avoid reserved-name issues).

2) ChillHuoSong / 寒蝉活宋体 (chip label: 寒蝉活宋)
   Project: https://github.com/Warren2060/ChillMovableType
   Official release: HuoSongv1.000 / ChillHuoSong_F.zip / ChillHuoSong_F_Regular.otf
   License: SIL OFL 1.1 — see OFL-ChillMovableType.txt
     https://github.com/Warren2060/ChillMovableType/blob/main/LICENSE
   This WOFF2 is a GB2312 Level-1 + punctuation + Latin subset. The textured
   outlines make a full GB2312 WOFF2 about 6.6MB, so Level-1 (常用一级汉字)
   is used to keep the lazy-loaded file smaller. Rare Level-2 characters may
   fall back to the next font in the stack.
   CSS family used here: CLEC-HuoSong.

3) LXGW WenKai GB Lite Regular / 霞鹜文楷 GB 轻便版 (chip label: 文楷)
   Project: https://github.com/lxgw/LxgwWenkaiGB-Lite
   Official release: v1.522 / LXGWWenKaiGBLite-Regular.ttf
   License: SIL OFL 1.1 — see OFL-LXGWWenKaiGBLite.txt
   Official OFL additional permission allows reserved names for webfont
   subset/format conversion that is not offered as an installable desktop font.
   This WOFF2 is a GB2312 + punctuation + Latin subset of the official Lite cut.
   CSS family used here: CLEC-WenKai.
   This is a legal kai-style substitute. It is NOT 仓耳今楷.

Not bundled (copyright; offered as local-only options in the reader):
- 仓耳今楷 (Tsanger JinKai), official site https://tsanger.cn/
  Product pages list a commercial license of ¥16000. Personal non-commercial
  use of a downloaded desktop font is allowed; it is not in the “永久免费商用”
  set (https://www.tsanger.cn/107.html). Not downloaded, not hosted.
- 方正兰亭黑, official site https://www.foundertype.com/
  Commercial Founder Type font; embedding requires a paid license.
  Not downloaded, not hosted.
